Gister in de brievenbus gekregen via Arja[.] Hartelijk[ bed]ankt voor het langsbrengen[.] Ben er meteen in begonnen[, was] speciaal even in niets nieuws begonnen o[md]at [ik] wist dat ie eraan[ z]at te komen[.] Ben benieuwd[.] Le[uk] dat[ he]t boek[ he]le[ma]al uit de US komt[!]
What a lovely book to read and nice photo's too[! Very] funny[.] A real feel-good-story as far as I['m] concerned, really liked it[.]
She[ sounds] gratefull for the carrier she has and[ doesn]

