The admission charges for Menara Taming Sari are RM[20 for an] adult[ and] RM[10 for] children below 12[ years] old[.] There[ is a] huge car park next to the tower.[ For] further information, please contact Melaka Taming Sari Berhad at +60-6-2881100 or +60-6-2813366.
